# Mandala Codes — redirect rules
# Processed top-to-bottom, first match wins.

# Legacy /oracle/* paths (in case anyone copied a URL from the old domain
# before adrianrasmussen.com's 301s were in place). The SPA also handles
# these via <Navigate>, but a server-side 301 is preferred for crawlers.
/oracle                         /                               301
/oracle/the-systems             /the-systems                    301
/oracle/universal-language      /universal-language             301
/oracle/universal-language/*    /universal-language/:splat      301
